return ['domain'=>'page-builder-sandwich','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'page-builder-sandwich','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-26T16:59:17+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-26T16:59:17+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Page Builder Sandwich','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/page-builder-sandwich'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/page-builder-sandwich','The foundation release of the rebuilt Page Builder Sandwich: a settings and About screen, a footprint-free front-end output layer, and one sample content block.'=>'Ìtúsílẹ̀ ìpìlẹ̀ Page Builder Sandwich tí a tún kọ: ètò àti ojú ìwé nípa, ìpele ìmújáde iwájú tí kò ní àpẹẹrẹ footprint, àti àpẹẹrẹ ìdènà àkó>kọ kan.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','AI providers'=>'Àwọn olùpèsè AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Awọn oluṣe ChatGPT. Oluranlọwọ ti o dara ni gbogbo ọna.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Àwọn olùṣẹ̀dá Claude. Wọ́n lágbára nínú kíkọ̀wé àti ẹ̀kọ́ ìṣọ́ra.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Awọn awoṣe Gemini ti Google. Yara ati olowo poku.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Ile-iṣẹ AI kan ti Ilu Yuroopu pẹlu awọn awoṣe ti o yara, ti ko si gbowolori.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Àwọn àwòṣe iye owó kékeré tí ó dára fún kíkọ àti kóòdù.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Bọtini kan fun awọn awoṣe lati ọpọlọpọ awọn olupese oriṣiriṣi.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Èyíkéyìí iṣẹ́ ìránṣẹ́ tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ bíi API ti OpenAI, títí kan àwṣ àwòkùṣe tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí kọmpútà tàbí sẹ́fà rẹ.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Ngbogbogbo (a n lo ti ko ba si nkankan pato ti a gbe kalẹ)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Kikọ ati tun-kikọ','Translation'=>'Ìtumọ̀','Code and CSS'=>'Koodu ati CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Má bínú, a kò yọ̀ǹda fún ọ láti wọ ojú ewé yìí.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Gbogbo àwọn plugin tó ń lò wọ́n pín àwọn ètò yìí: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Awon key re wa ni ipamo ninu ibi ifipamọ data aaye yii, a si n fi won ranṣẹ nikan si olupese ti o yan — ki i se si wa laelae.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Ìgbésẹ̀ 1 nínú 2: yan olùpèsè AI kan','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'O mu kọ́kọ́ra rẹ wa, nitorina o sanwo taara fun olupese fun ohun ti o lo. Ko ni idaniloju? Eyikeyi ninu wọnyi ṣiṣẹ daradara; o le ṣafikun diẹ sii nigbamii.','Next'=>'Nísinsìnyìí','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Igbesẹ 2 ti 2: sopọ %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Tẹ adirẹsi iṣẹ OpenAI-compatible rẹ sii, ti o pari pẹlu /v1. Bọtini kan nikan ni a nilo ti iṣẹ naa ba beere fun.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Ṣí %s kí o sì wọlé (tàbí kí o ṣẹ̀dá àkọọ̀lẹ̀ ọ̀fẹ́ kan).','the %s API keys page'=>'oju eka awọn bọtini API %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Ṣẹ̀dá kọ́kọ́rọ́ tuntun kan kí o sì da a si.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Lẹ̀ẹ́ mọ́ nínú rẹ̀ kí o sì tẹ "Save and test". A máa ń rán ìbéèrè kékeré kan láti ṣàyẹ̀wò pé ó ń ṣiṣẹ́.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Ọ̀pọ̀ jù lọ àwọn olùpèsè nílò ìdíwọ̀n owó díẹ̀ lórí àkáǹtì náà kí kọ́ọ̀sì kan tó lè ṣiṣẹ́: %s.','add credit'=>'fi kun kirẹditi','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Yan olupese miiran','Address'=>'Àdíréṣì','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Bọtìnì tí a fi pamọ́ parí sí …%s — lẹ́ẹ̀kan bọtìnì tuntun láti rọ́pò rẹ̀','Key (optional)'=>'Kọ́kọ́rọ́ (aṣàyàn)','API key'=>'Bọtìnì API','Save and test'=>'Fipamọ ki o si danwo','Providers'=>'Àwọn Olùpèsè','Provider'=>'Olupese','Status'=>'Ipo','Key'=>'Bọtìnì (Key)','Get a key'=>'Gbọ́ bọ́tìnnì kọ́kọ́ṣẹ́','Test'=>'Idanwo','Remove'=>'Yọ kuro','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'A ti fi ẹ̀yà àfikún tuntun pamọ́: ṣe ìgbàsílẹ̀ àfikún yìí, tàbí kí o tún bọtínì náà sílẹ̀.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Bọtìnì tí a ti fi pamọ́ kò ṣe é ṣí mọ́ (àwọn bọtìnì ààbò ojú-wẹ́bù náà yípadà). Tẹ ẹ sii lẹẹkan si.','Not connected'=>'Ko sopọ','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Ti sopọ — àdánwò tó kẹhin kọja %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Idanwo ti o kẹhin kuna: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Tí a sopọ̀ — a kò tíì dán wò','Which model to use'=>'Èwo nínú àwọn àpẹẹrẹ náà ni láti lò','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ jẹ́ àmì ìṣedúró wa fún iṣẹ́ yẹn. Àtòjọ náà ní gbogbo àwọn àwòṣe tí kọ́ọ̀sì rẹ lè lò, tí a kà ní tààràtà láti ọ̀dọ̀ olùpèsè náà.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— A ṣe iṣeduro fun olupese —','Save models'=>'Fi awọn awoṣe pamọ','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Sọ àwọn àkọlé àwọn àwòṣe di tuntun láti ọ̀dọ̀ àwọn olùpèsè','best quality'=>'èpò tó dára jùlọ','lowest cost'=>'iye ti o kere ju','fastest'=>'tètè jù','Add a model yourself'=>'Fi àwoṣé kún un fún ra rẹ','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Ṣé àwẹ àwòṣe tuntun jáde lónìí? Fi orúkọ rẹ̀ gangan sílẹ̀ láti lò ó lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀.','Model name'=>'Orúkọ àwòṣe','Add model'=>'Fi awoṣe kun','Recommended models list'=>'Àtòjọ àwọn àwoṣe tí a gbani nímọ̀ràn','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'A ko le rii daju pe atokọ awọn awoṣe ti a niyanju ni o tọ, nitorina a ko fihan awọn imọran kankan. Tun fi ẹnẹ-iṣẹ ṣiṣẹ (plugin), tabi tan awọn imudojuiwọn ojoojumọ ni isalẹ.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Àtòkọ tí a ń lò ni a tẹ̀ jáde ní %s. Ìgbékalẹ̀ ìgbékalẹ̀ pílúgì kọ̀ọ̀kan mú tuntun wá.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Ẹ tún ṣàyẹ̀wò Zinn Digital® lẹ́ẹ̀kan lọ́jọ́ kan fún àkójọ tí a sọ di tuntun.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ìbéèrè ìṣàwọlẹ̀ tí ó rọrùn nìkan ni a ń ránṣẹ́: kò sí kọ́kọ́rọ́, kò sí àdírẹ́sì ojú ẹ̀rọ, kò sí ohunkohun nípa àkóónú rẹ. A tọwọ́ si àkójọ náà, a sì máa ń gbójú fo àkójọ tí kò bá kọjá àyẹ̀wò ìtọwọ́sí náà.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Ìgbẹ̀yẹ̀gbẹ́ tí a ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ̀ kẹ́yìn %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Fi pamọ, ki o si ṣayẹwo ni bayi ti a ba tan','a newer list was installed'=>'a fi àkọ̀sílẹ̀ tuntun kan sori rẹ̀','already up to date'=>'ti ni imudojuiwọn tẹlẹ','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'gba download naa kuna ayẹwo ibuwọlu ati pe a foju si i','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'A ko le de ọdọ Zinn Digital®; àkójọ lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ yẹn ni a óò máa lo','turned off'=>'a pa','Open'=>'Ṣí','Check their status page'=>'Ṣẹ̀wò ojú ìwé ipò wọn','Open your billing page'=>'Ṣí ojúewé ìwé-owó rẹ','Open your API keys page'=>'Ṣí ojú ewé àwọn bọ́tìnnì API rẹ','Open the AI settings'=>'Ṣí àwọn ètò AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Ẹ jẹ̀wọ́, a ò yọ̀ǹda fún un yín láti ṣe bẹ́ẹ̀.','Unknown provider.'=>'Olupese ti a ko mọ.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Tẹ adirẹsi iṣẹ rẹ sii, fún àpẹẹrẹ http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Iyẹn kò dà bí bọ́tìnnì API. Ṣàkọṣẹ́ rẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i, láìsí ààyè àárín.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Fi bọtìni API rẹ sori ẹrọ kọkọ.','Key removed.'=>'A ti yọ kọ́kọ́rọ́ náà kúrò.','Models saved.'=>'Àwọn àwòṣe ti a fi pamọ́.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Tẹ orúkọ gangan àwoṣe náà sílẹ̀, fún àpẹẹrẹ bí ìwé àfikún olùpèsè náà ṣe kọ ọ́.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'A fi %s kun. Yan ni abẹ́ "Which model to use".','Model removed.'=>'Àwòṣe náà ti kúrò.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Àwọn ìgbékalẹ̀ ojúmọ́ ti wà ní pípa. A ń lò àkójọ tí ó wá pẹ̀lú plugin náà.','Checked: %s.'=>'A ti ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ̀: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'A tún àwọn àkójọ àwṣẹ́ sọ di tuntun.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Ẹya tuntun ti ọkan ninu awọn afikun rẹ lo fipamọ bọtini AI rẹ. Ṣe imudojuiwọn afikun yii, tabi tẹ bọtini naa sii lẹẹkan si ninu awọn eto AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'A kò lè tú bọ́tìnnì AI tí o ti fi pamọ́ sílẹ̀ mọ́ (àwọn bọ́tìnnì ààbò ojú-wẹ́bù náà yí padà). Tún tẹ ẹ́ sínú àwọn ètò AI náà.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'A kò tíì ṣètò AI. Fi bọ́tìnnì kọ́kọ́ra fún olùpèsè AI sínú àwọn ètò AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'A kò yàn àpẹẹrẹkankan fún iṣẹ́ yìí. Yan ọ̀kan nínú àwọn ẹ̀ka ìtòsí AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Àwọn oníbàárù AI yẹn kò ní ìṣègè rẹ̀ lọ́wọ́ ẹ̀dà yìí fún plọ́gìn náà.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Ojula yi ko le de ọdọ iṣẹ AI rẹ. Ṣayẹwo pe o nṣiṣẹ ati pe adirẹsi rẹ le de si lati ọdọ sẹ́fà wẹẹbu rẹ (iṣẹ kan lori kọmputa tirẹ ko le de si lati oju opo wẹẹbu ti a gbalejo).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Aaye yii ko le de %s. Ṣayẹwo oju-iwe ipo wọn; ti wọn ba wa lori ayelujara, agbalejo rẹ le n dina awọn asopọ ti n jade, tabi adirẹsi naa jẹ aṣiṣe.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s sọ pé kò sí káàdì tàbí kòótà tó kù ní ìpamọ́ rẹ. Fi owó kún un tàbí gbé ìwọ̀n rẹ sókè ní ìpamọ́ rẹ pẹ̀lú wọn, lẹ́yìn náà tún gbiyanju lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s kò gba kọ́ọ̀sì tí o fi sílẹ̀ náà. Ó lè jẹ́ pé ó jẹ́ àṣìṣe kíkọ, wọ́n ti fagilé rẹ̀ tàbí ó ti pé ọjọ́. Ṣẹ́da kọ́ọ̀sì tuntun kan kí o sì lẹ mọ́ ibi yìí.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s kọ ìbéèrè yìí fún bọtínì rẹ. Bọtínì náà le má ní ààyè sí àwṣ̀rọ̀ tabi ẹ̀ya yìí, tàbí kí akántì rẹ nílò ìmúdájú.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'A ko le ri awoṣe "%1$s" latiọdọ %2$s fun bọtọ̀ rẹ. Yan awoṣe miiran ninu awọn eto AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Ètò %2$s rẹ ko ni awoṣe "%1$s" ninu. Yan awoṣe miiran ninu awọn eto AI, tabi sọ eto rẹ di tuntun pẹlu wọn.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s n ṣe ìdíwọ́ fún ìyára tí bọ́tìnnì rẹ lè fi ránṣẹ́ àwọn ìbéèrè. Dúró fún ìṣẹ́jú kan kí o sì tún gbiyanju rẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i, tàbí kí o gbe ìwọ̀n tí o lè ránṣẹ́ sókè pẹ̀lú wọn.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s nìírírí àwọn ìṣòro báyìí (ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀ ìdúró tàbí ìjẹ́jù lórí apá wọn). Kò sí ohun tí kò tọ́ pẹ̀lú àwọn ètò rẹ. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i láìpẹ́.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Ìbéèrè AI náà kùnà fún ìdí kan tí a kò lè mọ̀. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i; tí ó bá ń ṣẹlẹ̀ sí i, kàn sí àtìlẹ́yìn pẹ̀lú àwọn kúlẹ̀kúlẹ̀ tó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ yìí.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Olupese AI naa dahun ni ọna ti pḷọọgìì ni ko le ka. Tun gbiyanju si tun; ti o ba n tẹsiwaju, yan awoṣe miiran tabi kan si atilẹyin.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Aṣeṣe (ti o ni ibamu pẹlu OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Fi bọtínì kan pamọ́ fún olùpèsè yìí kọ́kọ́.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Bọtini rẹ ṡe iṣẹ, ṣugbọn olupese naa ko ṣe at তালিকা awoṣe ọrọ kankan fun un. Ṣafikun awoṣe kan funrararẹ ni isalẹ.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Ti sopọ. %1$s ti dahun nipa lilo %2$s. Awọn ẹya ara ẹrọ AI rẹ ti ṣetan lati lo.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Ko si ni ipa olumulo rẹ lati lo AI lori aaye yii. Bi olùṣàkóso kan lọ́wọ́.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Ojula yii ti de opin inawo AI rẹ fun oṣu yii. Alabojuto le gbe e soke ni awọn eto AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Ojula yii ti de opin opin oṣooṣu rẹ ti awọn ibeere AI. Alabojuto le gbe e soke ni awọn eto AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Lilo ati idiyele','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀, àwọn ààlà, àti àwọn àṣẹ ipa wúlò fún AI tí a lò nípasẹ̀: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Àwọn iye náà jẹ́ àìnílọ́fà, a ṣe àkọọ́lẹ̀ wọn láti inú àwọn iye owó tí a tẹ̀ jáde; àwọn àwòṣe tí kò ní iye owó tí a mọ̀ ni a kà sí ojofo.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Oṣù yìí: %1$s àwọn ìbéèrè, nǹkan bí %2$s.','When'=>'Nigbati','Who'=>'Ta ni','Used for'=>'Ti a lo fun','Model'=>'Àpẹẹrẹ','Tokens in / out'=>'Awọn àmì ìdámọ̀ wọlé / jáde','About'=>'Nipa','Result'=>'Èsi','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Ko ti si awọn ibeere AI kankan ti a ṣe sibẹsibẹ.','Done'=>'Ti pari','Limits and permissions'=>'Àwọn ààlà àti àwọn àṣẹ','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Ààlà owó tí a ń ná lóṣù (US dollars)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Fi sílẹ̀ láìsí ààlà. AI yóò dúró fún ìyókù oṣù náà ní kété tí iye owó tí a fẹ́ fẹ́ dé ibẹ̀.','Monthly request limit'=>'Ìwọ̀n ìbéèrè lóṣooṣù','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Fi o fo si oju opo wẹbẹ fun aini opin.','Who may use AI'=>'Tani o le lo AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Ko kankan si silẹ lati jẹ ki gbogbo eniyan ti o le lo awọn ẹya ara ẹrọ plugin na lo AI. Awọn oludari le lo o nigbagbogbo.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Ṣe ìpamọ́ àwọn ààlà àti àwọn àṣẹ','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ awọn opin ati awọn àṣẹ.','Security error, please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Aṣiṣe ààbò, jọ̀ọ́ sọ ojú-ewé náà di tuntun kí o sì tún gbiyanju rẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan si.','Missing newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Àwọn ètò ìwé ìròyìn kò sí. Jọ̀wọ́ kàn sí aláṣẹ náà.','Invalid newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Àwọn ètò ìwé ìròyìn kò tọ́. Jọ̀wọ́ kàn sí olùṣàkóso náà.','Invalid email address.'=>'Adirẹsi imeeli ti ko tọ.','Too many attempts. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Àwọn ìgbìyànjú pọ̀ jù. Jọ̀wọ́ gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan si ní ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀ sẹ́yìn.','Something went wrong. Please contact the admin.'=>'Nkan kan ko tọ. Jọwọ kan si oluṣakoso na.','Map'=>'Ṣe àmì ojú-òpó','Background video'=>'Fidio abẹlẹ','%1$s: %2$d font files stored, stylesheet %3$s'=>'%1$s: %2$d awọn faili fọọti ti a fipamọ, iwe ara (stylesheet) %3$s','That family is not stored.'=>'A kò tọ́jú ìdílé yẹn.','Removed.'=>'Ti yọ kuro.','That is not a valid font family name.'=>'Orúkọ ìdílé fọ́ǹtì yẹn kò wúlò.','Google Fonts did not return that family. Check the name and try again.'=>'Google kò dá ìdílé yẹn padà. Ṣàyẹ̀wò orúkọ náà kí o sì tún gbiyanju lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','The font files could not be downloaded or saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Awọn faili fọọti naa ko le ṣe igbasilẹ tabi fipamọ. Ṣayẹwo pe folda igbasilẹ data (uploads folder) le ni kikọ si i.','The font stylesheet could not be saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Àwòse òrùkà fɔ́ntì náà kò lè fipamọ́. Ṣe ìvèwò pé a lè kó sínú folda àwòse ti a s̀e àpò sí.','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Awọn iwe afọwọkọ ti iboju abojuto sonu ninu ẹ̀dà yìí ti fọọmu (plugin). Tun fi sii lati inu àpò ti a tu silẹ.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Ojú-ìwé yìí nílò JavaScript.','Languages'=>'Àwọn èdè','Upgrade'=>'Ṣe igbega si ipele giga','Pricing'=>'Iye owó','Start Trial'=>'Bẹrẹ Idanwo','Account'=>'Akawọ','Contact Us'=>'Kanṣoṣo Wa','Affiliation'=>'Ìbáṣepọ̀','the kind of softwarePlugin'=>'Olùfẹnọ̀kan','greetingHey %s,'=>'Ẹ ǹlọ %s,','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Yọ̀ǹda láti gba àwọn ìfitónilétí Íméìlì fún àwọn àlàyé ààbò & ẹ̀yà ara, àwọn àkóónú ẹ̀kọ́, àti àwọn ìpèsè lẹ́ẹ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan, àti láti pín díẹ̀ nínú ìsọfúnni àyíká WordPress ìpìlẹ̀. Èyí yóò ràn wọ́n lọ́wọ́ láti jẹ́ kí %s ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú ojula rẹ àti pé ó dára jù lọ ní ṣíṣe ohun tí o nílò rẹ̀ fún.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Ṣe ìforúkọsilẹ láti gba ìfitónilétí imeeli fún àwọn àlàyé ààbò & àwọn àfikún ẹ̀yà ara, àwọn àkóbá ìkẹ́kọ̀ọ́, àti àwọn àǹfààní láìpẹ́, àti láti pín díẹ̀ lára ìfitónilétí àyíká WordPress.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Tí o bá fò èyí sílẹ̀, kò burú! %1$s yóò ṣì máa ṣiṣẹ́ dáadáa.','Allow & Continue'=>'Gbà tẹ́ sì tẹ̀síwájú','verbSkip'=>'Fò já sí kọjá','Skipping, please wait'=>'Fífò le kọjá, jọ̀wọ́ dúró','Continue'=>'Tẹsiwaju','Please wait'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ dúró','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Ńṣe ìmúṣẹ','This will allow %s to'=>'Èyí yóò jẹ́ kí %s lè','Privacy Policy'=>'Ètò Àṣírí','Terms of Service'=>'Àwọn Òfin Iṣẹ́','License Agreement'=>'Àdéhùn Ìwé-àṣẹ','Have a license key?'=>'ṢE O NI KỌKỌRỌ ÌWÉ-ÀṢẸ?','Activate License'=>'Mu Ìwé-àṣẹ ṣiṣẹ','View Basic Profile Info'=>'Wo Alaye Ipilẹ Profaili','Your WordPress user\'s: first & last name, and email address'=>'Oruko olumulo WordPress rẹ: oruko akọkọ & ikẹhin, ati adiresi imeeli','View Basic Website Info'=>'Wo Alaye Ipilẹ Oju Opo Wẹẹbu','Homepage URL & title, WP & PHP versions, and site language'=>'URL ojú-ewé ile & akọle, àwọn ẹ̀yà WP & PHP, àti èdè ojú-ewé ayélujára','View Basic %s Info'=>'Wo Alaye Ipilẹ %s','Current %s & SDK versions, and if active or uninstalled'=>'%s lọwọlọwọ & awọn ẹya SDK, ati pe o nṣiṣẹ tabi ti yọ kuro','Newsletter'=>'Iwe iroyin','Updates, announcements, marketing, no spam'=>'Awọn imudojuiwọn, awọn ikede, titaja, kò sí spam','View Diagnostic Info'=>'Wo Alaye Ìwádìí Rẹ','WordPress & PHP versions, site language & title'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀yà WordPress & PHP, èdè & àkọlé ojú òpó wẹ́bù','View Plugins & Themes List'=>'Wo Àkójọ Àwọn Ìfikún & Àwọn Àkòrí','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Àwọn orúkọ, àwọn slug, àwọn àtúnṣe, àti bóyá wọ́n ṣiṣẹ́ tàbí wọn kò ṣiṣẹ́','optional'=>'àṣàyàn','Never miss an important update'=>'Má ṣe jẹ́ kí àfikún pàtàkì kankan kọjá ọ̀ rẹ','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'A ti ṣe àfikún ìyọ̀ǹda yìí kí o má baà pọfu àwọn ìsọfúnni pàtàkì kankan kí o sì lè ràn wọ́n lọ́wọ́ láti jẹ́ kí %s bá ojú-wọ̀ṣẹ́ rẹ mu dáadáa, kí ó sì túbọ̀ máa ṣe àwọn ohun tí o nílò rẹ̀ fún un dáadáa.','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'E se fun imudojuiwọn si %1$s v%2$s!','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Àlẹ̀mọ́ náà gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ lẹ́tà kékeré 1 sí 8 tàbí nọ́mbà, kí ó bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà kan, kí ó sì má ṣe sọ orúkọ plugin náà.','You are not allowed to edit this item.'=>'A kọ̀ ọ́ lọ́wọ́ láti ṣàtúnṣe ohun yìí.','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'A kò yọ̀ǹda fún ọ láti ṣe èyí.','Safe mode was turned off because it no longer matches your login. Reload the page.'=>'A ti pa ipo àìléwu rẹ (Safe mode) kúrò nítorí kò bá ìwọlé rẹ mu mọ́. Ṣe àtúnṣe ojú-ewé náà.','Only an administrator can use safe mode.'=>'Olùṣàkóso nìkan ni ó lè lo ipò àìléwu.','Safe mode needs a normal browser login.'=>'Ipo ààbò nílò ìwọlé aṣàwákiri déédéé.','Safe mode could not be set up.'=>'A kò lè ṣètò ipò àìléwu.','Safe mode needs write access to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Modo ailewu nilo aṣẹ kikọ si folda wp-content/mu-plugins.','Safe mode could not write to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Ipo ailewu ko le kọ si folda wp-content/mu-plugins.','Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio','That page does not exist, or it has been deleted.'=>'Ojú-ewé yẹn kò sí, tàbí a ti pa á rẹ́.','Sorry, you are not allowed to edit this item in Sandwich Studio.'=>'Ẹ bẹ̀ ọ́, a ò fún ọ ní àṣẹ láti ṣe àtúnṣe sí ohun èlò yìí ní Sandwich Studio.','Sandwich Studio is not built. Reinstall the plugin.'=>'A kò mọ Sandwich Studio. Tun fi plọọgi-in ná sori ẹrọ rẹ.','Add title'=>'Fi akọle kun','Type / to choose a block'=>'Tẹ / láti yan bálóòkùù','Loading Sandwich Studio…'=>'Ṣíṣe ìgbékalẹ̀ Sandwich Studio…','Sandwich Studio needs JavaScript. Use the normal editor instead.'=>'Sandwich Studio nilo JavaScript. Lo olootu deede dipo rẹ.','Edit “%s” with Sandwich Studio'=>'Ṣatọ “%s” pẹlu Sandwich Studio','Edit with Sandwich Studio'=>'Ṣàtúnṣe pẹ̀lú Sandwich Studio','Blank canvas'=>'Fọ́tò tí kò ní ohunkóhun lórí rẹ̀','A migration step is running right now. Try again in a minute.'=>'Ìgbésẹ̀ ìṣípòpadà ń lọ lọ́wọ́ báyìí. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i ní ìṣẹ́jú kan.','Thank you for subscribing!'=>'Ẹ ṣe opolopo fun ìforúkọsílẹ!','Something went wrong. Please contact the administrator.'=>'Nkan kan ko tọ. Jọwọ kan si olutọju eto naa.','Years'=>'Àwọn ọdún','Months'=>'Oṣù','Weeks'=>'Àwọn Ọ̀sẹ̀','Days'=>'Ọjọ','Hours'=>'Awọn wakati','Minutes'=>'Awọn iṣẹju','Seconds'=>'Àìkú','Go to slide %d'=>'Lọ sí nú sláìdù %d','You\'re already subscribed to our newsletter'=>'O ti ṣe alabapin tẹlẹ si iwe iroyin wa','Email address is already subscribed.'=>'Aẹnus si àtẹ ozi-e ti forukọsilẹ tẹlẹ.','MailPoet plugin not found. Please contact the admin.'=>'A ko ri aṣọ-ìsopọ MailPoet. Jọ̀wọ́ kan alábòójútó náà.','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Tirẹ nipasẹ Neil Lock, Alaga ti Zinn Digital® Ltd','Version %s'=>'Ẹya %s','Page Builder Sandwich website'=>'Wọ́ọ̀bùsìtì Page Builder Sandwich','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Ojula oju opo wẹbusiti Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'A ti fi àwọn ẹ̀yà ara pamọ́.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Wo awọn ètò Pro ati awọn owo rẹ','Front-end output'=>'Abajade iwaju-ipari','Class name prefix'=>'Àlẹ̀mọ́ orúkọ kílàsì','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Gbogbo orúkọ kilásì tí plọ́gìnnì náà tẹ̀ jáde sórí ojú ewé rẹ bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú àfikún yìí, kí àwọn ojú ewé náà má bàa fi hàn pé èwo ni plọ́gìnnì tí ó kọ́ wọn. Lédè tàbí nọ́mbà kékeré 1 sí 8, tí ó bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà kan.','Save'=>'Fi pamọ́','Beta updates'=>'Àwọn ohun ìgbàlejò tí wọ́n ṣẹ̀ṣẹ̀ ń dánwò','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Ojula itanna yii n gba awọn ẹya beta gẹgẹ bi imudojuiwọn.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Ojula yii n gba awọn ẹya iduro nikan.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Yi eyi pada sori oju-iwe Akawunti','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Awon ẹya beta ni a n fún awọn fifi sori ẹrọ Pro ti o ni iwe-ašẹ ti o si ni asopọ si akọọlẹ wọn. Ni kete ti o ba ni asopọ, o le darapọ mọ lati oju-iwe Akọọlẹ.','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'Ìbéèrè fún yíyí àpilẹ̀kọ yìí padà dáwọ́ dúró kí ó tó parí, nítorí náà a fò á kọjá. Ṣí i láti yí i padà, tàbí kí o tún yí i padà láti ibi yìí.','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'Ko si afẹyinti ifiweranṣẹ yii lati mu pada sipo.','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'A kò lè fi àwọn ohun tí a yí padà sí pamọ́.','Unknown error.'=>'Àṣìṣe àìmọ̀.','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'Àכו́nù ìصàìnìì tí a ti ṣe àyèwò fún kò tìì wà.','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Mu ohun ti a jogun pada: %1$d ninu %2$d awọn ifiweranṣẹ.','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Yí akópawé atijọ padà: %1$d nínú %2$d àwọn àfikún.','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'Ìṣẹ̀dá padà parí: %1$d ti padà bọ̀ sípò, %2$d kùnà.','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'Ìyípadà parí: %1$d ti yí padà, %2$d kò yí padà, %3$d kùnà.','Legacy content'=>'Akoonu atijọ','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'Awọn ojú-ewé tí a fi àwọn ẹ̀yà Page Builder Sandwich tẹ́lẹ̀ṣẹ̀ ṣe ni a ń yí padà sí àwọn blọọku lẹ́yìn. A ṣe àfikún afẹ́yinti fún gbogbo post ní àkọ́kọ́, nitorinaa a le da ìyípadà kọ̀ọ̀kan padà.','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'Fífọ́kànsì %d ṣì ní àkóովé àtijọ́ nínú.','%d post has a backup.'=>'%d post ni afẹyinti kan.','%d post could not be handled'=>'Kò ṣeé ṣe láti ṣe àkóso àpilẹ̀kọ %d kan','Post %d'=>'Ifihan %d','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Ìyípadà bẹ̀rẹ̀. Ó ń tẹ̀ síwájú ní ẹ̀yìn; o le kúrò lórí ojú-ewé yìí.','Convert legacy content'=>'Yi akoonu atijọ pada','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'Ṣe àtúnṣe gbogbo àpilẹ̀kọ tí a ti yí padà sí ohun àlùmọ́ni wọn tẹ́lẹ̀? Àwọn àtúnṣe tí a ṣe sí àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ yẹn láti ìgbà tí a ti yí wọn padà yóò sọnù.','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Ìṣẹ̀dá sẹ́yìn bẹ̀rẹ̀. Ó ń tẹ̀ síwájú ní ẹ̀yìn; o le kúrò ní ojú ewé yìí.','Undo all conversions'=>'Pa gbogbo iyipada rẹ kuro','Shortcode tag'=>'Àmì kékeré fún ìlà kíkúrú','Use letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Lo lẹta, nọmba, àmì iyọkuro ati àmì abẹlẹ nikan.','Attribute name'=>'Orúkọ ànímọ́','Add attribute'=>'Fi àfikún kún un','Content'=>'Akoonu','Shortcode'=>'Koodu Kúrúsì','Choose a shortcode tag in the block settings.'=>'Yan ami aami kukuru kan ninu awọn eto bulọọki naa.','The "%s" control from the old editor is not available in the block editor. Enter the value as text.'=>'Ìṣàkóso "%s" láti inú olootu àtijọ́ kò sí ní olootu bọ́lọ́kì náà. Tẹ iye náà sínú gẹ́gẹ́ bí ọ̀rọ̀.','Choose image'=>'Yan àwòrán','Choose file'=>'Yan fáìlì','— Default —'=>'— Aiyipada —','Advanced styling'=>'Ìlànà aṣọ tó ga julọ','Inline CSS'=>'CSS Abẹnu','CSS declarations, for example: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333'=>'Àwọn ìkéde CSS, fún àpẹrẹ: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333','Effects (legacy classes)'=>'Àwọn ipa (àwọn kíláìsì ìṣẹ̀dá àtijọ́)','Space-separated effect names carried over from older versions, for example: hover-shadow'=>'Àwọn orúkọ ipa tí a pín nípa lílo àlàfo tí ó wá láti àwọn ẹ̀dà àtijọ́, fún àpẹẹrẹ: hover-shadow','Row'=>'Ahọnni','Width'=>'Ìbú','Content width'=>'Ìgbòòrò àkóónú','Full width'=>'Gbogbo iwọn','Full width, content kept in the middle'=>'Fífẹ̀ kíkún, a pa àwọn àkóónú mọ́ láàárín','Link'=>'So pọ̀ọ̀kùn','Link address'=>'Àdírẹ́sì ìjápọ̀','Open in a new tab'=>'Ṣíṣí ní taabu tuntun kan','Link relationship'=>'Asiko idapo awon oju-opona','Alignment'=>'Àgbékalẹ̀','None'=>'Kankan','Left'=>'Apa osi','Centre'=>'Àárín','Right'=>'Ọtún','Button text'=>'Ọrọ bọtini','Add text…'=>'Fi ọrọ kun…','Icon'=>'Àmì','SVG markup'=>'Àmì SVG','Scripts, links and external references are removed before the icon is shown.'=>'Awon afiwe, awon isopọ ati awon itọka ita ni a ma n yọ kuro ki a to fi aami naa han.','Accessible label'=>'Àmìwò ẹ̀rọ alábòójútó tí ó ṣeé wọlé','Leave empty for a decorative icon.'=>'Fi sílẹ̀ láìsí nǹkankan fún àmì ìṣọ́ṣọ́.','Paste SVG markup in the block settings.'=>'Fi ami SVG sinu awọn eto bulọọki.','New setting name'=>'Orúkọ ètò tuntun','For example: title or text'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ: àkọlé tàbí ọrọ̀','Add setting'=>'Fi ètò kun','Widget'=>'Wíjẹ̀tì','Choose a widget'=>'Yan wiṣeti kan','Widget area'=>'Agbegbe Wigi','Choose a widget area'=>'Yan agbegbe fídíìítì kan','This image has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Choose it from the Media Library, or set its width and height.'=>'Àwòrán yìí kò ní ìbú tàbí gíga, nítorí náà ojú ìwé náà yóò fò nígbà tí ó bá ń kó. Yan án láti inú Àkójọ Àwòrán, tàbí kí o ṣètò ìbú àti gíga rẹ̀.','This video is not from the Media Library, so its size is unknown and the page will jump when it loads. Upload it to the Media Library instead.'=>'Fidio yìí kò wá láti Ilé Ìkópamọ́ Àwòrán, nítorí náà a kò mọ ìwọ̀n rẹ̀, ojú ewé náà yóò sì fó lọ sókè nígbà tí ó bá ń kó. Ṣe àgbéṣọ rẹ̀ sí Ilé Ìkópamọ́ Àwòrán dípò bẹ́ẹ̀.','An image, video or frame in this HTML has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Add width and height attributes to it.'=>'Àwòrán, fídíò tàbí fífírù kankan nínú HTML yìí kò ní ìbú àti gíga, nítorí náà ojú ewé náà yóò fò nígbà tí ó bá ń kó. Fi àwọn àbùdá ìbú àti gíga kún un.','This embed resizes itself after it loads, which moves the content below it. Give it room or place it lower on the page.'=>'Èké yìí ń tún iwọn ara rẹ̀ ṣe lẹ́yìn tí ó bá gbé wọlé, èyí tí ó ń gbe àwọn ohun inú tó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ rẹ̀ kúrò ní ipò. Fún ní àyè tàbí gbé e sí ìsàlẹ̀ diẹ lórí ojú ewé náà.','Layout shift'=>'Yiyipada Iṣeto','Heading'=>'Orí-ọ̀rọ̀','Text'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀','Style'=>'Àwòrán Ìrísí','Plain'=>'Wọn','Accent'=>'Ìfihàn èdè','No languages to switch between. The switcher appears when a translation plugin lists two or more languages.'=>'Ko si awọn ede ti o le yipada laarin wọn. Oluyipada naa yoo han nigbati afikun itumọ ba ṣe at তালিকা ede meji tabi ju bẹẹ lọ.','Switcher'=>'Olùyípadà','Show the current language'=>'Fi ede lọwọlọwọ hàn','%s is also editing this page. Saving may overwrite their changes.'=>'%s náà tún ń ṣe àtúnṣe ojú ewé yìí. Ìpamọ́ lè sọ àwọn àtúnṣe wọn di asán.','Block library'=>'Ilé kíkọ àwọn ohun tí a dènà','Layers'=>'Àwọn ìpele','Close panel'=>'Pa pátákì náà','Page canvas'=>'Ojú ìwé fọ́nrán','Revisions'=>'Àwọn àtúnṣe','Block settings'=>'Àwọn ètò ìdènà','Add block: %s'=>'Fi bulọọki kun: %s','(no title)'=>'(kò sí àkọlé)','Open in Studio: %s'=>'Ṣí nínú Studio: %s','Undo'=>'Fagile mo','Redo'=>'Tun se','Show or hide layers'=>'Fi han tabi tọ́ fẹlẹfẹlẹ','Show or hide the block library'=>'Fi hàn tàbí pa ile ikawe bulọọki mọ','Show revisions'=>'Fi awọn atunyẹwo han','Open the normal editor'=>'Ṣii olùṣatunṣo déédéé','Keyboard shortcuts'=>'Àwọn ọ̀nà àbájọ bọ́tìnnì tẹlifóònù','Preview: desktop'=>'Ayẹwo: kọmputa tabili','Preview: tablet'=>'Àwòrán Àkọ́kọ́: tábìlì','Preview: mobile'=>'Àpẹẹrẹ: mobile','Copy style of the selected block'=>'Ṣe àwọn àṣà àti ìrísí ohun tí o ti yàn lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́','Paste style onto the selected block'=>'Lẹ́ mọ́ sórí blọ́kì tí a yàn','Copy the selected section'=>'Da apakan ti a yan n’ṣe','Paste a copied section'=>'Lẹ̀ mọ́ apá kan tí a dá se ẹ̀dọ̀kọ̀wé','Turn off safe mode'=>'Pa ipo ailewu rẹ kuro','Turn on safe mode (other plugins off, for you, in Studio only)'=>'Tan ipo aabo (awọn afikun miiran pa, fun ọ, ni Studio nikan)','Published'=>'Ti tẹjade','Scheduled'=>'A ti ṣètò rẹ̀','Pending review'=>'Wọ́n ń ṣe àyẹ̀wò rẹ̀','Private'=>'Ikọọkan','Draft'=>'Àkọpamọ́','All changes saved'=>'Gbogbo ayipada ti wa ni ipamọ','Saving…'=>'Ìpamọ́ lọ́wọ́…','Autosaving…'=>'Ìfipamọ́ fúnra rẹ̀…','Unsaved changes'=>'Àwọn àyípadà tí kò tíì fipamọ́','autosaved'=>'ti a fipamọ laifọwọyi','Desktop preview'=>'Ayẹwo oju opo wẹẹmu lori kọmputa tabili','Tablet preview'=>'Àwòrán àkọkọ ti tábìlì','Mobile preview'=>'Ààyè àwòrán fún fóònù alágbèékùn','Studio toolbar'=>'Ọpa irinṣẹ Studio','Back to the normal editor'=>'Pad bẹ sí olùṣàtúnṣe déédéé','Page title'=>'Akọlé ojú-ewé','Preview width'=>'Iwọn awotẹlẹ','Command palette'=>'Paleti àṣẹ','View page (opens in a new tab)'=>'Wo ojú-ewé náà (ó ṣí ní tàbù tuntun kan)','Update'=>'Ṣe imudojuiwọn','Save draft'=>'Fipamọ iwe afọwọkọ','Publish'=>'Tẹjade','Restore unsaved changes?'=>'Ṣe o fẹ́ mú àwọn àyípadà tí kò tíì fipamọ́ padà bọ̀ sípò?','This page has changes that were never saved. They were kept in this browser:'=>'Ojú-ewé yìí ní àwọn àtúnṣe tí kò tíì fipamọ́ rí. A tọ́jú wọn sínú aṣàwákiri yìí:','This page has a newer autosave than the saved version:'=>'Ojúewé yìí ní ìpamọ́ àràǹgbá tó tuntun ju ẹ̀yà tó ti dáná sílẹ̀ lọ:','Restore unsaved changes'=>'Mu awọn ayipada ti a ko fipamọ bọ sipọ','Discard'=>'Pa tì','Revisions could not be loaded.'=>'Àwọn àtúnṣe kò lè kó àwọn wọlé.','Revision restored. Save to keep it, or undo to go back.'=>'Àtúnṣe ti padà bọ̀ sípò. Ṣe ìpamọ́ láti tọ́jú rẹ̀, tàbí kí o fagile láti padà sẹ́yìn.','Close revisions'=>'Pa awọn atunyẹwo kuro','No revisions yet. Each save makes one.'=>'Ko si àtúnyẹwò kankan síbẹ̀. Ìpamọ́ kọ̀ọ̀kan máa ń ṣẹ̀dá ọ̀kan.','Revision from %s'=>'Àtúnyẹ̀wẹ̀ láti ọwọ́ %s','Restore this revision'=>'Muu àtúnṣe yìí bọ̀ sípò','Cancel'=>'Fagilee','Safe mode could not be changed.'=>'A kò lè yí ipò àìléwu padà.','Safe mode is on.'=>'Ipo ailewu wa ni titan.','%d other plugin is switched off, for you and in Sandwich Studio only. The live site and other users are not affected.'=>'%d àfikọ̀ tòótọ́ míràn ti pa, fún ọ àti ní Sandwich Studio nìkan. Ojú-wẹ́bù wíwà alààyè àti àwọn olùṣe mìíràn kò ní ipa kankan.','Safe mode: switch other plugins off in Studio, for you only'=>'Modo ailewu: pa àwọn àfikún yòókù ní Studio, fún ìwọ nìkan','Safe mode'=>'Ipo aabo','Save your changes.'=>'Fipamọ awọn ayipada rẹ.','Undo your last change.'=>'Pa iyipada rẹ ti o kẹhin kuro.','Redo your last undo.'=>'Tun ṣe iṣẹ afipamọ rẹ to kẹhin.','Show or hide the layers panel.'=>'Fi hàn tàbí fi pa pálẹ̀ kíkún sẹ́hìn.','Display these keyboard shortcuts.'=>'Fi awọn ọna abuja kiibọọju wọnyi han.','Select a block first.'=>'Yan bulọọki kan ni akọkọ.','Style copied. Paste it onto any block, on this site or another.'=>'Aṣọ tii daakọ. Lẹẹmọ sori eyikeyi bulọọki, lori aaye yii tabi omiran.','The browser refused to copy.'=>'Ẹ̀rọ àwárí kò jẹ́ kó ṣe ẹ̀dà.','Section copied. Paste it into any page, on this site or another.'=>'A ti da apakan naa. Ṣe lẹẹmọ rẹ sinu eyikeyi oju-iwe, lori aaye yii tabi omiran.','The clipboard does not hold a style copied from Sandwich Studio.'=>'Ko si àṣà tí a dá kọ̀ sí orí clipboard láti Sandwich Studio.','Style pasted onto %d block.'=>'Àwoṣe ti a lẹ̀ mọ́ori bọ́ọ̀lu %d.','That style does not fit the selected block.'=>'Ara yẹn kò bá bọ́ síi pẹ̀lú bọ́ọ̀kì tí a yan.','The clipboard does not hold a copied section.'=>'Pátì kọ́ọ̀bù náà kò ní apá kan tí a dá.','Section pasted.'=>'A ti lẹ apakan na.','Paste style'=>'Fi aṣa pamọ','Paste section'=>'Ṣẹ́gun abala','Press Ctrl+V (or Cmd+V on a Mac) here to paste'=>'Tẹ Ctrl+V (tabi Cmd+V lori Mac) nibi lati lẹ mọ́ ọn','Copy style'=>'Da aṣa kọọkan','Copy section'=>'Ṣàkọ́ ìpín náà','Edit in Sandwich Studio'=>'Ṣàtúnṣe nínú Sandwich Studio','Saving failed. Check your connection and try again; your changes are kept in this browser.'=>'Ìpamọ́ kùnà. Ṣàyẹ̀wò ìsopọ̀ rẹ kí o sì tún gbiyanju lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i; a ti pa àwọn àtúnṣe rẹ mọ́ sínú aṣàwákiri yìí.','Published.'=>'Ti a tẹjade.','Saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ.','block titleButton link'=>'Ọna asopọ bọtini','block descriptionA link styled as a button.'=>'Ọna aṣopọ kan tí a ṣe bí bọtìnì.','block keywordbutton'=>'bọtìnì','block keywordlink'=>'ọna asopọ','block keywordcall to action'=>'pè láti ṣe ohun kan','block titleColumn'=>'Kọlọmọ','block descriptionA column inside a row. It can hold any block.'=>'KỌLÙMÙ kan laarin rọ́wọ́ kan. O le gbe eyikeyi bulọọki mu.','block keywordcolumn'=>'kọlọmù','block keywordlayout'=>'èdè ojú-iṣẹ́','block titleLanguage switcher (sample)'=>'Ayipada ede (àpeẹrẹ)','block descriptionLists the site\'s languages from the translation plugin, when one is active. It renders nothing otherwise.'=>'Ó ṣe àkójọ àwọn èdè ojú-wọlé láti inú plọ́gìnnì ìtumọ̀, nígbà tí ẹnì kan bá ń ṣiṣẹ́. Kò ní fi ohunkohun hàn bí bẹ́ẹ̀ kọ́.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Èdè','block keywordswitcher'=>'olùyípadà','block titleSample content'=>'Àkọsẹ̀ṣe àpẹẹrẹ','block descriptionA heading and a paragraph, rendered with neutral class names. It is the reference block for the translation contract.'=>'Oríkì kan àti ìpínrọ̀ kan, tí a fi àwọn orúkọ kíláàsì tí kò ní ẹ̀gbẹ́ hàn. Ó jẹ́ bálọ́ọ̀kù ìtọ́kasí fún àdéhùn ìtumọ̀ náà.','block keywordsample'=>'àpẹẹrẹ','block keywordtext'=>'ọ̀rọ̀','block titleIcon'=>'Àwòrán kékeré','block descriptionAn SVG icon. The markup is cleaned before it is shown.'=>'Àwòrán SVG kan. A ti sọ àmì náà di mímọ́ kí a tó fi hàn.','block keywordicon'=>'àmì-ìdánimọ̀','block keywordsvg'=>'svg','block titleRow'=>'Ahọnni','block descriptionA row of columns. Stays readable if the plugin is ever turned off.'=>'Ọ̀wọ́ àwọn kọlọmù. Ó máa ń wa ní ẹ̀ka tí ó ṣe é kà bí a bá pa plọ́gìn (plugin) náà tì láé.','block keywordrow'=>'igboro','block keywordcolumns'=>'àwọn Òpó','block titleShortcode (add-on)'=>'Koodu kukuru (afikun)','block descriptionA shortcode from an add-on written for the classic Page Builder Sandwich editor, with the settings the add-on declared.'=>'Ṣọ́tíkò láti inú àfikún kan tí a kọ fún olootu Page Builder Sandwich ti ìbílẹ̀, pẹ̀lú àwọn ètò tí àfikún náà kéde.','block keywordshortcode'=>'koodu kukuru','block keywordadd-on'=>'fún-ún-ṣe','block titleWidget area'=>'Agbègbè Widget','block descriptionShows the widgets in one of the theme\'s widget areas.'=>'Ó fi àwọn widget hàn ní ọ̀kan lára àwọn agbègbè widget ti tiimu náà.','block keywordsidebar'=>'apadi ẹgbẹ','block keywordwidget area'=>'agbègbè wígìtì','block titleWidget'=>'Wọ́gìtì','block descriptionShows one of the site\'s registered classic widgets.'=>'Ó fi ọ̀kan nínú àwọn wídìgì (widgets) aláìlẹ́gbẹ́ ti ojú opó wẹ́bù hàn.','block keywordwidget'=>'widijeti']];